71146596128194_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6KXSJT5sUpkQ7kNvwEzrC1d&_nc_oc=AdocMLCcVkWYn2aioEDuGYikzyuznfkhJsOETN7aGbls_bumlk6Li4B_wyrVHDLXfl4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJqBJDzs3Yk_Bqah2bpH91NnYhBHAuIWnCRkrP9SOysVw&oe=6AAD3839"}, {"file_name": "1.png", "id": "2116332565928774", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622315_2116332569262107_6472776043868426897_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=lXhHahxcZlUQ7kNvwFlIpVq&_nc_oc=AdrME6qdtycEU-Tt-ztfXeBeMXfy35W2OsDHcYGd2NAfni0EYP_wyHtyZ0AKSmlget0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQL7arNEQyS2R01X1Ro7jjE_US0Am1ALN5Wn7jG37eQwsQ&oe=6AAD4B13"}, {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "909457358817429", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623558_909457362150762_5574869297430657880_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gQywFOKisgkQ7kNvwG6IUKQ&_nc_oc=AdpiVSJKWVM5i2yYI67x3K70K5pjjYd66amOn_J2FPA41D61OnnlquzDBkxRCkt_ruk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQINjbqUFI_Zfu_CCoreDbCPs0ri7BiWtjRpz-NXiqesUQ&oe=6AAD495A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Wild", "keywords": ["social", "free", "hangout", "friends", "chat"], "long_description": "**Explore with friends.**\n\nWild is one big social space. Walk across the map, follow the noise, visit other players, or let your curiosity lead the way.\n\n**Life as a duck.**\n\nCustomize your duck avatar, and express yourself in ways only possible inside VR. Walk, run, or jump around with hand-based movement.\n\n**Welcome to the community.**\n\nWhen you join Wild, you\u2019re joining a new world that is constantly changing. Tune into events, changes to the map, or try out the latest cosmetics.\n", "short_description": "Wild is a social VR hangout world. Explore a shared city, meet friends, and host events."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https: